# Comment consent

Never post comments to GitHub or Linear unless Drew explicitly asks. Drafting in chat or a local file is fine. A plan, a review, or "I'll reply" is not a request to publish. "Post this," "reply to that comment," or "comment on the ticket" is.

Standing exception: the `pr-review` skill's final step may create or extend an unpublished (`PENDING`) GitHub pull-request review with inline comments. That is not consent to submit or publish the review, reply on threads, or post issue or Linear comments. Submitting or publishing still needs an explicit ask ("publish the review", "submit the review").
